 // Static assets that form the app shell.
 //
-// Versioned assets (CSS + JS) include `?v=__WEBUI_VERSION__.jaegerpd4` to match the
+// Versioned assets (CSS + JS) include `?v=__WEBUI_VERSION__.jaegerpd6` to match the
